Position: Associate
Le rôle
The Content and Technology Editor (CTE) acts as digital and content leader of the group, managing and coaching a team around digital and mobile innovations. While the CTE is primarily responsible for the editorial and technical delivery of content and digital offerings, the position will serve as primary point-of-contact to provide guidance and ensure alignment between internal teams and stakeholders.
Responsibilities
- Directs and oversees the delivery of content within multiple channels (web, mobile, social media);
- Provides full leadership over internal and external communications to ensure messages are well-articulated and effective across numerous channels;
- Ensures that key content is delivered within expected timelines and budget parameters;
- Guides other teams and platforms on using content;
- Provides insight and direction into market best practices for using digital tools, technology, and formats; and
- Direct and manage day-to-day digital content operations and best practice guidelines.
Qualifications
- Minimum five years of progressive experience

